  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be defined as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"center left\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;is continuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is equal to:</p>"
  },
